				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " function throws an error that renders a Next.js 401 page. It's useful for handling authentication errors, when a request is not signed in. You can customize the UI using the "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "../03-file-conventions/unauthorized.md",
